The '''2026–27 season''' is [[Juventus FC|Juventus Football Club]]'s 129th season in existence and their 20th consecutive season in the top flight of [[Football in Italy|Italian football]]. In addition to the [[2026–27 Serie A|domestic league]], Juventus is participating in the [[2026–27 Coppa Italia|Coppa Italia]] and the [[2026–27 UEFA Europa League|UEFA Europa League]].

